         <component>
            <section ID="LINK_a89b81ba-f3c9-47ef-884d-5e071cdb5d01">
               <id root="ad1961c7-428d-41ea-8e93-3f25d11e0472"/>
               <code code="34084-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="ADVERSE REACTIONS SECTION"/>
               <title>ADVERSE REACTIONS</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Allergic sensitization has been reported following oral administration of folic acid.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Adverse reactions are generally rare at recommended dosages; however, hypersensitivity reactions may occur.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260421"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="LINK_b9633771-fe08-40f1-b8b6-0c6c0c384eb2">
               <id root="e1fbfea1-003c-4659-8a52-a65bd53ae35c"/>
               <code code="34088-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OVERDOSAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>OVERDOSAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>In case of accidental overdose, seek professional assistance or contact a poison control center immediately.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260421"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="LINK_d0f103a6-74ee-4a6e-904c-5f2784a308f0">
               <id root="1007c76d-4332-402e-a0d8-edce8c648117"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>DOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Usual adult dosage is <content styleCode="bold">one tablet daily</content>, to be <content styleCode="bold">dissolved in the mouth or chewed before swallowing</content>, or as directed by a licensed healthcare practitioner</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260421"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="LINK_d859b791-0c43-487a-9b90-4ce71da84563">
